     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">Dear all,</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I am unable to run any applications using shiny-server. I get:</p><h1 style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:13px;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif\"><br></h1><h1 style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:13px;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif\">An error has occurred</h1><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">The application failed to start.</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">The application exited during initialization.</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"> </p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">Running the same applications with runApp works. Web pages with no R code work as well. I have tried to remove (purge) and reinstall the server but no luck. Any suggestions?</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"> </p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">Thank you</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"> </p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">Dan</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"> </p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700\">Shiny-server version:</span> 1.4.4.801</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700\">OS:</span> Ubuntu 16.4 LTS x86_54 (kernel 4.4.0-34)</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700\"><br></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700\">s</span><span style=\"font-weight:700\">hiny-server.conf:</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">log_dir /var/log/shiny-server/;<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">run_as :HOME_USER: shiny;<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">server {<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">listen 3838;<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">simple_scheduler 15;</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">location / {<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">user_dirs;</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">directory_index off;<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">}<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">}</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"> </p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700\">Sys.getenv():</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">COLUMNS 80<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">DISPLAY localhost:10.0<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">EDITOR vi<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">HOME /home/user<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">LANG en_US.UTF-8<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">LD_LIBRARY_PATH /usr/lib/R/lib:/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu:/usr/lib/jvm/default-java/jre/lib/amd64/server<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">LESSCLOSE /usr/bin/lesspipe %s %s<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">LESSOPEN | /usr/bin/lesspipe %s<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">LINES 24<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">LN_S ln -s<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">LOGNAME user<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">MAIL /var/mail/user<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">MAKE make<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">PAGER /usr/bin/pager<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">PATH /usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin:/usr/games:/usr/local/games<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">PWD /home/user<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_ARCH<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_BROWSER xdg-open<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_BZIPCMD /bin/bzip2<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_DOC_DIR /usr/share/R/doc<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_GZIPCMD /bin/gzip -n<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_HOME /usr/lib/R<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_INCLUDE_DIR /usr/share/R/include<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_LIBS_SITE /usr/local/lib/R/site-library:/usr/lib/R/site-library:/usr/lib/R/library<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_LIBS_USER ~/R/x86_64-pc-linux-gnu-library/3.2<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_PAPERSIZE letter<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_PAPERSIZE_USER letter<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_PDFVIEWER /usr/bin/xdg-open<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_PLATFORM x86_64-pc-linux-gnu<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_PRINTCMD /usr/bin/lpr<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_RD4PDF times,inconsolata,hyper<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_SESSION_TMPDIR /tmp/Rtmpy5EVtO<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_SHARE_DIR /usr/share/R/share<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_SYSTEM_ABI linux,gcc,gxx,gfortran,?<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_TEXI2DVICMD /usr/bin/texi2dvi<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_UNZIPCMD /usr/bin/unzip<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R_ZIPCMD /usr/bin/zip<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">SED /bin/sed<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">SHELL /bin/bash<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">SHLVL 1<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">TAR /bin/tar<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">TERM xterm<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">USER user<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">XDG_RUNTIME_